    relative residual ||S(eps) f - S(0) f - eps dS f|| / ||eps dS f|| at eps = 1e-2, 5e-3, 2.5e-3: 1.37e-03, 6.85e-04, 3.43e-04  (falls as eps^1.00: the absolute residual is second order; all matrices finite: True)
